00:01:30.404 --> 00:01:35.574
Your neighbors, half of whom are migrants,

00:01:35.574 --> 00:01:43.750
who have come because their counties
are too hot, flooded or fragile.

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:46.331
Let that sink in.

00:01:46.331 --> 00:01:50.017
Your oldest is finally going to college.

00:01:50.017 --> 00:01:51.504
What a relief?

00:01:51.504 --> 00:01:53.242
And your youngest, well,

00:01:53.242 --> 00:01:57.411
