00:02:05.797 --> 00:02:07.734
You're forced to reckon with yourself.

00:02:10.671 --> 00:02:15.228
Are my unbridled successes worth

00:02:15.228 --> 00:02:19.626
what I have left to my children?

00:02:19.626 --> 00:02:22.632
This look into the future,

00:02:22.632 --> 00:02:28.651
our future is not meant to paralyze or
instill fear no.

00:02:28.651 --> 00:02:33.456
Because it's not written in stone for
the next 30 years,

00:02:33.456 --> 00:02:36.348
if there's one thing you ask of me.

00:02:36.348 --> 00:02:43.220
That can shift the narrative on climate
change, it is not these three things.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:50.377
Put all your money in one stock,
put all your money in one job or

00:02:50.377 --> 00:02:56.585
